  "intro": [
    "Every AWS Config operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with",
    "it. The service is JSON 1.1 under the `config` credential scope with the",
    "`StarlingDoveService` target prefix, and has no console action. Rules, the",
    "configuration recorder and the delivery channel are upserts keyed by name; no",
    "evaluation engine runs, so compliance is the documented `INSUFFICIENT_DATA` shape."
